My Response:
Well, yeah maybe because those things do work and actually matter towards improving our bodies instead of going straight to trying a temporary fix. So perhaps it makes some sense why someone might turn their nose up at such a notion, even me who initially didn’t entirely discount its potential benefits.

But hey, I still think having awareness around cleansing our system isn't necessarily wrong - especially when it involves maintaining balanced meals filled with fruits/veggies alongside keeping fit levels up via consistent physical activities;

